    "Answer A (Delay to 70 Default): Wait until 70 to claim Social Security \u2014 the 8% annual delayed credit is an unbeatable risk-free return for healthy individuals, and maximizes inflation-adjusted lifetime income if you live past 82.",
    "Answer B (Claim at 62 for Immediate Need): Claim at 62 if you have health concerns, need the income to avoid portfolio withdrawals, or lack other retirement income \u2014 the breakeven math favors early claiming for shorter life expectancies.",
